exports[`renderSecurityReport > is deterministic and orders the remediation list by severity 1`] = `
"# OpsCrew security report: shop

Checked on 2026-10-11 12:00 UTC with OpsCrew 0.1.0. Server: \`203.0.113.10\`.

## Summary

**3 problems to fix** (1 critical, 2 medium) and 1 warning.

| Area | Result |
|---|---|
| Code scan | 0 critical, 0 high, 1 medium, 0 low, 0 info |
| Infrastructure policies | 1 passed, 1 failed |
| Server hardening | 1 passed, 0 failed, 1 warning, 0 skipped |
| Outside probes | 0 passed, 1 failed, 0 warnings, 0 skipped |

## What to fix

1. **Critical** · Outside probe: Port 6379 (Redis/Valkey) is reachable from the internet. — \`203.0.113.10\`
   Expected: Port 6379 (Redis/Valkey) is closed to the internet.
   **Fix:** Close it in the Hetzner firewall.
2. **Medium** · Code scan: Container runs as root — \`Dockerfile:1\`
   The image has no USER instruction.
   **Fix:** Add a non-root USER.
3. **Medium** · Infrastructure policy: Server is protected against accidental deletion — \`module.server.hcloud_server.this\`
   Delete protection is off. Turn it on.
4. **Low (warning)** · Server: Security updates were installed that need a reboot.
   Expected: No reboot pending.
   **Fix:** Reboot the server.

## Code scan

| Severity | Findings |
|---|---|
| Critical | 0 |
| High | 0 |
| Medium | 1 |
| Low | 0 |
| Info | 0 |

| Severity | Finding | Where | Rule |
|---|---|---|---|
| Medium | Container runs as root | \`Dockerfile:1\` | \`config/docker-root-user\` |

Not run: gitleaks (skipped: gitleaks is not installed).

## Infrastructure policies

| Result | Severity | Policy | Details |
|---|---|---|---|
| Pass | High | Server has a firewall | The server is attached to a Hetzner Cloud firewall. |
| **Fail** | Medium | Server is protected against accidental deletion | Delete protection is off. Turn it on. |

## Server hardening

Checked over SSH as the unprivileged \`deploy\` user (no sudo).

| Result | Severity | Check | Details |
|---|---|---|---|
| Pass | Medium | Brute-force protection (fail2ban) is running | fail2ban is active. |
| Warn | Low | No reboot pending | Security updates were installed that need a reboot. |

## Outside probes

Connections attempted from this machine to \`203.0.113.10\`.

| Result | Severity | Check | Details |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Fail** | Critical | Port 6379 (Redis/Valkey) is closed to the internet | Port 6379 (Redis/Valkey) is reachable from the internet. |

---

Generated by OpsCrew 0.1.0. Run \`opscrew secure\` to refresh it. No secret values are included in this report.
"
`;

